2 º inability to serve in Rwanda Defense 2
Forces, in any capacity;
3 º loss of the right of access to public 3 employment;
4 º loss of the right to vote and be elected; 4
5 º deprivation of the right to wear any 5 decoration or any other sign worn as a mark of honor.
